# Third-Party Licenses

This file lists third-party dependencies used by the Java modules in this
project (`flink/` and `iac/roots/datasources/data-generator/generator/`).
Dependencies marked `provided` or `test` scope are excluded from bundled
artifacts as they are supplied by the runtime platform or not shipped.

Regenerate with:

    mvn -f flink/pom.xml org.codehaus.mojo:license-maven-plugin:2.4.0:add-third-party
    mvn -f iac/roots/datasources/data-generator/generator/pom.xml org.codehaus.mojo:license-maven-plugin:2.4.0:add-third-party

